  - SAG milling
  - statistical analysis
abstract: >-
  Supplementary code and aggregated data for a computational M-3 mine-to-mill
  simulation study. Includes a deterministic synthetic profile generator,
  research simulation engine, batch runner, software tests, aggregated results
  from two full experiments and scripts for confirmatory statistical analysis.
  Synthetic inputs are not field measurements or recovered historical records.
